parameters.description:
Pal6 read request type ('ReadValues' - reports all station/sniffer/AP/replay configurations for the specified radio
when Preferred values for apStaMode are 'STA'/'SNIFFER'/'AP'/'REPLAY';
Backwards compatible values allowed are 'MODE_STA'/'MODE_SNIFFER'/'MODE_AP'/'MODE_REPLAY';
'WiFiSTAScan' - reports all available WiFi connections and their configurations, PAL6 must be in STA mode)

