request.description:
Push request will push all the configurations to the device; To enable/disable the radios at once use WiFiEnable request;
To change bandConfig use WiFiBandConfigUpdate request; For StandByMode use StandByMode request;
To individually do a Station/AP start use WiFiSTAStart/WiFiAPStart; To individually do a Station/AP start use WiFiSTAStop/WiFiAPStop;
To individually do a Station/AP update use WiFiSTAUpdate/WiFiAPUpdate;
To push a Replay config, use WiFiReplayUpdate
To individually start/stop a pal6 device replay use WiFiReplayPlaybackStart/WiFiReplayPlaybackStop

